pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">11.02.4128<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">December 6, 2016<br/>Winter Update 2016</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20161108200043&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Porcelain_Mask_a351d6.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a porcelain mask <span class=\"p-attributes\">(Arm:1, protection mana drain +10%)</span>.<br/>Classification: 2 Tier: 0.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 4.50 oz.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>It is one of the four permanent protector equipments against <a href=\"#/wiki/Mana%20Drain\">Mana Drain</a>, the other three being the Witch Hat, Depth Ocrea and the <a href=\"#/wiki/Starlight%20Vial\">Starlight Vial</a>. The last one and the Porcelain Mask do not have vocation requirement.\n</p><p>You can obtain one every 5 days when the <a href=\"#/quest/the-first-dragon-quest\">First Dragon Quest</a> is active. 3 are needed for the <a href=\"#/quest/festive-outfits-quest\">Festive Outfits Quest</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul class=\"creature-list-generic no-results\"><li>This item is not dropped by any creatures.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC sells this item.</p></div>\n<div class=\"trades\" id=\"w-npc-trade-sellto\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sell_To\">Sell To</span></h4><table class=\"wikitable sortable\"><tbody><tr><th>NPC</th><th>Location</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\">Price</th></tr><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Yasir\">Yasir</a></td><td>Varies</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">2,000 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Gold\"><img alt=\"Gold\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Icon_f66d4c.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li>Depth Ocrea</li><li>Equipment Upgrade</li><li><a href=\"#/quest/festive-outfits-quest\">Festive Outfits Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Mana%20Drain\">Mana Drain</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Quest%20Items\">Quest Items</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Starlight%20Vial\">Starlight Vial</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/the-first-dragon-quest\">The First Dragon Quest</a></li><li>Tibia's 20th Anniversary</li><li>Witch Hat</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/World%20Quests\">World Quests</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Yasir\">Yasir</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["festive-outfits-quest","the-first-dragon-quest"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"the-first-dragon-quest","quest":"The F